{"candidateAnswer":"He speaks very highly of her and says she makes him feel energized and happy. He considers himself fortunate to have found her.","evidence":"[D5:1 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, how's it going? Last week I went on a trip to Canada and something unreal happened - I met this awesome Canadian woman and it was like something out of a movie. She's incredible and being with her makes me feel alive.\n[D5:3 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Evan: Woah. such a nice view! Thanks, Sam! She's definitely great. Every moment with her is really fun and energizing. It's a nice change, especially after dealing with health issues. But you never know what life's gonna throw at you. Btw look what life has thrown for me right now haha.\n[D23:3 | 1:32 pm on 6 January, 2024] Evan: Thanks, Sam! It was an awesome moment, and I feel really lucky to have found someone who gets me. Plus, our families are really happy for us - that's the best part!","itemId":"urn:uuid:1f9d15fd-fa2e-5c88-b3a6-95b60de0dd7d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:3636b2fc0e947a9571d4cbc0be65d240f8a5c2d93b006211d682469f52f10bf5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How does Evan describe the woman and his feelings for her that he met in Canada?","referenceAnswer":"He says she's cool, incredible, like something out of a movie, and that he feels alive around her. Every moment with her is fun and energetic, also Evan feels really lucky to have someone who gets him.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"3636b2fc0e947a9571d4cbc0be65d240f8a5c2d93b006211d682469f52f10bf5"}}]}